A discussion uses two runner-owned linked conversations. The long-lived instrukt runner relays finished human and agent contributions with original attribution and supports closure for both members. Link opening and closure currently have no specified user/runtime entrypoint: report that gap to the dispatcher. Focused roles report in their own output/artifacts; workers report upward through native child-result delivery.
